Z||000000||Rumor||12-10-2001||04:08 PM||||Here's my situation:<BR>The Headlight motor will not stop moving. either direction, up or down. I pulled out the blue wire and the green/white wires from the relay, and now, at least I can drive the car with the headlights up. Any Idea what the culprit is? It seems that the motor doesn't get the message to "shut the HELL off"<P>I'd look up the schematics in the manual, but it is currently 65 miles away...<BR>THANKS!<P>-Rumor<BR>85 Silver GT (with eyes open)<BR>||||reg||1
